  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Simulation.Interactables.MedicalDeviceHotspot
  deviceNumber: 6
  deviceNameEnglish: Mayo Stand & Sterile Instrument Trolley
  whatItDoesEnglish: Holds and organizes sterilized surgical instruments (scalpels,
    forceps, retractors, sutures) within immediate reach of the scrub nurse and operating
    surgeon.
  howItWorksEnglish: Maintains a strict aseptic barrier using sterile drapes over
    a height-adjustable stainless-steel tray, organized systematically by surgical
    phase (incision, dissection, hemostasis, closure).
